# Supplier catalogue media for the lighting & fittings page — 25MB of stock
# JPEGs and showroom videos, several carrying another brand's watermark. The
# stills already live on Cloudinary (folder `fittings`) and the site loads them
# from there, so these local originals are a staging area, not a dependency:
# nothing in the build reads this folder. Ignored because it is otherwise one
# stray `git add -A` away from being in history permanently, which has happened
# once already. Import with backend/app/scripts/import_fittings.py.
frontend/public/Photo/
